# Host-side build/test artifacts must never enter the image build context:
# the in-image `dotnet build` is incremental, and a copied _output/ with DLLs
# newer than the sources makes it skip compilation and package STALE binaries
# (bit us 2026-07-07: a deploy shipped the previous build's Readarr.Core.dll).
_output/
_tests/
node_modules/
.git/
# MSBuild incremental caches. Directory.Build.props redirects intermediates to
# _temp/obj/, so a host-side SDK-container build leaves compiled DLLs there that
# make the in-image build skip compilation and package them as-is (this shipped
# a stale Readarr.Core.dll three deploys in a row on 2026-07-07).
_temp/
src/**/obj/
src/**/bin/
